{
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"g-obsidian","type":"group","x":-1440,"y":-700,"width":1040,"height":920,"color":"2","label":"A. Obsidian Vault / 知識庫結構"},
    {"id":"g-tooling","type":"group","x":-260,"y":-700,"width":900,"height":920,"color":"6","label":"B. Local Wiki Tooling / 本地維護工具"},
    {"id":"g-runtime","type":"group","x":800,"y":-700,"width":980,"height":920,"color":"4","label":"C. Web Runtime / 遊戲與輸出表面"},
    {"id":"g-review","type":"group","x":-1440,"y":360,"width":3220,"height":430,"color":"5","label":"D. Review / Lint / Growth Loop"},

    {"id":"title","type":"text","x":-1400,"y":-1030,"width":1340,"height":220,"color":"1","text":"PBS Obsidian / Wiki / Zine / NPC 現有架構圖\nCurrent architecture after spec-kit 019.\n\n核心原則：Sources 保存原始資料；Wiki 產生可引用、可審核的 compiled notes；Schema/Review/Logs 維持證據邊界；Web runtime 讀取資料但不自動改寫 raw sources。"},
    {"id":"integration-note","type":"file","file":"Schema/obsidian-app-integration.md","x":-20,"y":-1010,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"6"},
    {"id":"architecture-note","type":"file","file":"PBS Runtime Architecture.md","x":320,"y":-1010,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"1"},

    {"id":"sources","type":"text","x":-1390,"y":-610,"width":290,"height":260,"color":"5","text":"Raw Sources / 原始來源\n\n• Sources/Hackteria Full\n• Sources/SGMK Full\n• Sources/How To Get What You Want Full\n• Source Categories\n\nRule: preserve source; do not rewrite raw evidence."},
    {"id":"semantic","type":"text","x":-1060,"y":-610,"width":290,"height":260,"color":"2","text":"Bridge Layers / 橋接層\n\n• PBS Semantic Layers\n• PBS Entity Layers\n• sourceCards.enriched.json\n• categoryGraph.enriched.json\n\nPurpose: turn raw corpus into searchable cultural terrain."},
    {"id":"wiki","type":"text","x":-730,"y":-610,"width":290,"height":260,"color":"2","text":"Compiled Wiki / 整理後知識\n\n• Wiki/Concepts\n• Wiki/Methods\n• Wiki/Materials\n• Wiki/SocialForms\n• Wiki/Projects\n• Wiki/NPCs / Pets / Zines\n\nNotes must carry sourceRefs."},
    {"id":"wiki-index","type":"file","file":"Wiki/index.md","x":-1390,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"wiki-method-sample","type":"file","file":"Wiki/Methods/sgmk-diy-electronics-workshop-kits.md","x":-1100,"y":-280,"width":310,"height":110,"color":"2"},
    {"id":"wiki-log","type":"file","file":"Wiki/log.md","x":-750,"y":-280,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"5"},
    {"id":"vault-dashboard","type":"file","file":"PBS Wiki Visual Dashboard.md","x":-1390,"y":-110,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"1"},
    {"id":"graph-guide","type":"file","file":"GRAPH_VIEW_GUIDE.md","x":-1100,"y":-110,"width":250,"height":110,"color":"1"},

    {"id":"wiki-tool","type":"text","x":-210,"y":-610,"width":350,"height":300,"color":"6","text":"scripts/wiki_tool.py\n\nImplemented CLI:\n• hybrid-search\n• build-note\n• lint-evidence\n• terrain-gap-lint\n\nNo recrawl. No large dependency. Writes only reviewable Wiki/Review/Logs artifacts."},
    {"id":"hybrid-search","type":"text","x":180,"y":-610,"width":410,"height":170,"color":"6","text":"hybrid-search\n\nReads sourceCards.enriched.json. Scores title, keywords, categories, excerpts, semantic topics, and graph-neighbor metadata."},
    {"id":"build-note","type":"text","x":180,"y":-390,"width":410,"height":170,"color":"6","text":"build-note\n\nCreates source-bounded draft notes with sourceRefs, Evidence, Citations, Draft Claims, related topics, and Open Questions."},
    {"id":"lint-evidence","type":"text","x":180,"y":-170,"width":410,"height":170,"color":"6","text":"lint-evidence\n\nChecks compiled Wiki folders for missing/broken sourceRefs, thin evidence, missing citation sections, duplicate titles, and overclaiming language."},
    {"id":"schema","type":"text","x":-210,"y":-250,"width":350,"height":210,"color":"6","text":"Schema / Firewall / Maintainer\n\n• frontmatter-schema.md\n• lint-checklist.md\n• llm-wiki-maintainer.md\n• agentic-firewall.md\n• obsidian-app-integration.md"},

    {"id":"app","type":"text","x":850,"y":-610,"width":330,"height":230,"color":"4","text":"webview-ui/src/App.tsx\n\nRuntime shell:\n• map interactions\n• PBS Computer panel\n• NPC trigger gating\n• Question Pet HUD\n• zine iframe display\n• editor gating"},
    {"id":"pbs-computer","type":"text","x":1220,"y":-610,"width":500,"height":160,"color":"3","text":"PBS Computer / Campfire\n\nPlayer query -> local wiki search context -> DeepSeek Worker -> short answer + source/wiki links -> optional zine generation."},
    {"id":"npc-flow","type":"text","x":1220,"y":-400,"width":500,"height":220,"color":"4","text":"NPC Dialogue Flow\n\nNear NPC is not enough. Player must click NPC/prompt bubble or press Space. RpgDialogue loads persona, transcripts, wiki links, retrieved evidence, then calls DeepSeek proxy. zh-TW output is constrained to Traditional Chinese."},
    {"id":"zine-flow","type":"text","x":850,"y":-330,"width":330,"height":300,"color":"4","text":"Zine Generation Flow\n\nQuestion -> entry notes -> sourceCards/wikilinks -> runDaydreamWorkflow -> evidence coverage gate -> LLM section writing -> official template -> artifact guard -> public zine + print/save PDF."},
    {"id":"runtime-boundary","type":"text","x":1220,"y":-120,"width":500,"height":160,"color":"5","text":"Current boundary\n\nRuntime already reads semantic/entity entry notes and sourceCards. It does not yet prioritize compiled Wiki notes from build-note as zine RAG context."},

    {"id":"lint-report","type":"file","file":"Wiki/Logs/evidence-lint-2026-05-29.md","x":-1390,"y":470,"width":310,"height":110,"color":"5"},
    {"id":"terrain-gap","type":"file","file":"Review/terrain-gaps/latest.md","x":-1030,"y":470,"width":300,"height":110,"color":"5"},
    {"id":"pet-growth","type":"text","x":-690,"y":435,"width":470,"height":190,"color":"5","text":"Question Pet Growth Signals\n\nseed -> sprout -> branch -> blossom -> fruit\n\nSignals: evidence_found, gap_detected, gap_resolved, question_matured, terrain_promoted. Private runtime dialogue is not auto-written into Sources."},
    {"id":"visualization","type":"text","x":-160,"y":435,"width":540,"height":190,"color":"5","text":"Cultural Terrain Visualization\n\nPBS is not Connected Papers. It maps concepts, methods, materials, social forms, projects, evidence heat, timeline, community overlaps, and terrain gaps; not only citation similarity."},
    {"id":"zine-quality","type":"text","x":440,"y":435,"width":570,"height":190,"color":"5","text":"Zine Quality Loop\n\nCurrent: evidence gate blocks unsupported abstract synthesis.\nNext: export compiled Wiki notes into web-readable context, filter with lint-evidence, then feed citations/sourceRefs into zine generation."},
    {"id":"npc-review","type":"text","x":1070,"y":435,"width":620,"height":190,"color":"5","text":"NPC Review Loop\n\nNPC pages and transcripts remain source-bounded. Dialogue uses persona/transcript/wiki-link context at runtime. Reviewed dialogue domains can be documented in Wiki/NPCs or Review/npc-agent-pages, not raw sources."}
  ],
